<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli warplanes struck the Iranian consulate in Damascus, killing a guards commander, and Israeli artillery hit positions in Al-Quneitra countryside. Gunmen posing as security forces abducted a Kurdish woman law student in Damascus. Turkish forces condemned the Israeli incursions while Turkish, Israeli and Kurdish actors continue to vie over Syria's new order, and Mazloum Abdi and Masrour Barzani met to discuss Kurdish rights. Four Syrian road security personnel were killed in an attack in eastern Hama. The conflict produced 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBjY245VUZyaXhiU3hueFBkeWJfLU9LcXdESDFIQldES0J6QWhOODFjbHMtZFRPYUpOTmZSTWl1RFNOYU50SlZyVmVzTHdESjVpM2k4aU9saktqdHVpV2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNazFfT1pndUxrdE9QX19IaDBrVlo1bE9NR1dmQnZsU2ZLS3NtdDd3dHB2SVZWYTlkakd2MEFFSjVDeVpOd3JpbEVlcmtES285OG5jNG5EajZ0VGhzMnJEZEFmTm1wRnVFRGtpd1JuMXNmUVFvT0dzYURFeWZNZENJTWlsMllXZGFiRDVDV1cyeHE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab Center Washington DC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxPY1lnb2dDYUdxaDlYSG1vcFFMRG1SSWR0aFh4LWp3MGxnT01QVlRHdG1TbWdWZGJSbVFRTlFfNjRYc1FhTHhmel9BNktKakZrVFZlQVBPOGZTdUxJRFZGYzYwNGxmT1VNcC02aC1MT2xIOVR0YmpzbnZuY0FvVzdZR2IzaDBrTGlGVGc5dFdtRjRkZFJ3eXgtd2FraXJxQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Insight International&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE9mM2ZxR0lZUV9jd1g5UzRiVjgzd1ZEamxmY29fUHNaN2ZwV0VoekhEenczbU1FRF91YUpMYlY3T3lKWWxNR3hQTmNZR2FRc21oNlhSRl9adTBHT0tJcXA3eENuWnhXeXZoZEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE1lTmppZzFLZFZTRVEwZHVDai1MdF